WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Efficiency View shows org, department, and agent usage.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Set token and error budgets so spend warns, then blocks.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Retention days control how long chats and runs survive; purge is deliberate.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Storage metrics tell you when inbound media is growing.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Strategy without budgets is a hobby; with budgets it is an operating system.
